# Tests

This folder contains end-to-end tests for the final binary or installer package.

Warning: Run these tests only on a development machine or in a CI/CD container.
The tests install and remove an SNClient service.

Run the tests with:

    go test -v

Note: On Windows, these tests build and install a .msi file.

## Requirements

- go

## Requirements Windows
- go
- wix.exe
- a prepared `windist` folder with `snclient.exe`, `windows_exporter.exe`
- a `snclient.msi` file in the `t` folder
